g with colleagues to identify funding for the junction improvements described under 5.2 of the report. As discussed, the funding mechanisms under the Roads Investment Strategy have changed and we no longer have Local Network Management Schemes (LNMS) funding. The new funding is called Designated Funds and we are currently exploring various avenues to gain the approval we require to deliver the scheme at the junction of Station Road. The matter has been","summary":"Funding secured for Station Road junction improvements","timescale":"next year"}]}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/vichal-tonpradit/","title":"Vichal Tonpradit","date":"2016-10-11","coroner":"Geoffrey Sullivan","area":"Hertfordshire","ref":"2016-0380","categories":["Road (Highways Safety) related deaths"],"responses":[{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/2016-0380-Response-by-Highways-England.pdf","filename":"2016-0380-Response-by-Highways-England.pdf","promises":[{"id":766,"quote":"The raised section of kerb separating the off slip road from the main carriageway on the A1(M) at Junction 6 northbound is addressed at point 6a. below.","summary":"Address raised kerb at Junction 6 northbound","timescale":"March 2020"}]}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/kevin-hefferman/","title":"Kevin Hefferman","date":"2016-10-25","coroner":"Graham Danbury","area":"Hertfordshire","ref":"2016-0381","categories":["Road (Highways Safety) related deaths"],"responses":[{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/2016-0381-Response-by-Highways-England.pdf","filename":"2016-0381-Response-by-Highways-England.pdf","promises":[],"unmatched":true}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/margaret-jones/","title":"Margaret Jones","date":"2017-02-22","coroner":"Peter Harrowing","area":"Avon","ref":"2017-0053","categories":["Road (Highways Safety) related deaths"],"responses":[{"pdf_url":"h