ww.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/seth-thind-prevention-of-future-deaths-report/","title":"Seth Thind: Prevention of future deaths report","date":"2022-10-17","coroner":"Christopher Wilkinson","area":"Hampshire, Portsmouth and Southampton","ref":"2022-0323","categories":["Suicide (from 2015)"],"responses":[{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/2022-0323-Response-from-Hampshire-County-Council.pdf","filename":"2022-0323-Response-from-Hampshire-County-Council.pdf","promises":[],"unmatched":true},{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/2022-0323-Response-from-National-Highways.pdf","filename":"2022-0323-Response-from-National-Highways.pdf","promises":[],"unmatched":true}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/josie-archer-smith-prevention-of-future-deaths-report/","title":"Josie Archer-Smith: Prevention of future deaths report","date":"2022-12-07","coroner":"James Dillon","area":"Mid Kent and Medway","ref":"2022-0399","categories":["Road (Highways Safety) related deaths"],"responses":[{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/2022-0399-Response-from-National-Highways-Limited.pdf","filename":"2022-0399-Response-from-National-Highways-Limited.pdf","promises":[{"id":1735,"quote":"South East Regional Operations Centre (SEROC) set variable message signs to display","summary":"Display skid risk slow-down messages on overhead signs when water present","timescale":"08 February 2023"},{"id":1736,"quote":"170 metres of combined kerb drainage jetted, 200 metres x 2 Acco drains jetted and a full CCTV drainage survey carried out","summary":"Jetted and cleaned drainage systems to improve water removal","timescale":"08 February 2023"},{"id":1737,"quote":"200 metres of combined kerb drainage jetted and cleaned; ▪ 150 metres of centre reserve drainage channel cleaned;","summary":"Repaired and installed drainage infrastructure to prevent water accumulation","timescale":"08 February 2023"},{"id":1738,"quote":"M20 Medway and Allington Deck Refurbishment scheme is due to be delivered between June and July 2023","summary":"Refurbish carriageway with improved drainage and textured surfacing","timescale":"June-July 2023"}]},{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/M20-Junction-5-6.pdf","filename":"M20-Junction-5-6.pdf","promises":[]}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/jordan-pry-prevention-of-future-deaths-report/","title":"Jordan Pry: Prevention of future deaths report","date":"2022-12-30","coroner":"Richard Travers","area":"Surrey","ref":"2023-0003","categories":["Road (Highways Safety) related deaths"],"responses":[{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/2023-0003-Response-from-National-Highways.pdf","filename":"2023-0003-Response-from-National-Highways.pdf","promises":[{"id":1824,"quote":"CP have commissioned a review from WSP, an independent engineering consultant, of CPS drainage maintenance arrangements for all the roads for which they are responsible.","summary":"Commission independent review of drainage maintenance regime.","timescale":"16 June 2023"},{"id":1825,"quote":"With CP, NH have commissioned CPS to review the effectiveness of the existing fixed warning sign to identify whether any measures are possible, within the legislative provisions that govern signage, to enhance the visibility of the sign.","summary":"Review existing fixed warning sign effectiveness.","timescale":"28 April 2023"},{"id":1826,"quote":"With CP, NH has commissioned WSP to undertake an independent review of the drainage system in the vicinity of Clacket Lane to identify whether any improvement could be made which would be likely to reduce the risk of flooding on the carriageway.","summary":"Independent review of drainage system to reduce flooding risk.","timescale":"16 June 2023"},{"id":1827,"quote":"With CP, NH has commissioned CPS, with support from a contractor, Milestone Infrastructure, to consider the viability of reprofiling the carriageway to shorten the drainage flow paths across the carriageway.","summary":"Assess viability of reprofiling carriageway to improve drainage flow.","timescale":"1 September 2023"}]}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/steven-easdale-prevention-of-future-deaths-report/","title":"Steven Easdale: Prevention of future deaths report","date":"2023-02-13","coroner":"Geoffrey Sullivan","area":"Herefordshire","ref":"2023-0054","categories":["Road (Highways Safety) related deaths"],"responses":[{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2023-0054-Response-from-Hertfordshire-County-Council.pdf","filename":"2023-0054-Response-from-Hertfordshire-County-Council.pdf","promises":[],"unmatched":true}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/benjamin-teague-prevention-of-future-deaths-report/","title":"Benjamin Teague: Prevention of future deaths report","date":"2023-03-17","coroner":"Anne Pember","area":"Northamptonshire","ref":"2023-0096","categories":["Road (Highways Safety) related deaths"],"responses":[{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2023-0096-Response-from-National-Highways.pdf","filename":"2023-0096-Response-from-National-Highways.pdf","promises":[],"unmatched":true}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/david-levett-prevention-of-future-deaths-report/","title":"David Levett: Prevention of future deaths report","date":"2023-04-18","coroner":"Anne Pember","area":"Northamptonshire","ref":"2023-0121","categories":["Road (Highways Safety) related deaths"],"responses":[{"pdf_url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/2023-0121-Response-from-National-Highways.pdf","filename":"2023-0121-Response-from-National-Highways.pdf","promises":[]}]},{"url":"https://www.judiciary.uk/prevention-of-future-death-reports/amal-ahmed-prevention-of-future-deaths-report/"